        <param name="bounds">The bounding rectangle of the annotation.</param>
        <param name="textContent">The text content of the annotation</param>
        <summary>Creates a new free text annotation with the specified bounds and text content.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Creates a new free text annotation with the specified bounds and text content.</para>
          <para>The default text color and background color will be black and white respectively.
            Also, transparency of the text color can't be modified i.e. alpha value of the text color
            will always be 1</para>
