        <value>The text color.</value>
        <remarks>
          <para>Property getter documentation:</para>
          <para>Returns the text color of the freetext annotation.</para>
          <para>
            <format type="text/html">
              <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/pdf/component/FreeTextAnnotation#getTextColor()" title="Reference documentation">Java documentation for <code>android.graphics.pdf.component.FreeTextAnnotation.getTextColor()</code>.</a>
            </format>
          </para>
          <para>Property setter documentation:</para>
          <para>Sets the text color of the annotation.</para>
          <para>Please note that the transparency of the color can't be modified. Alpha value of the text
            color will always be 1 (i.e. fully opaque) even if a color with different alpha value is
            set using this method</para>
          <para>
            <format type="text/html">
              <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/pdf/component/FreeTextAnnotation#setTextColor(int)" title="Reference documentation">Java documentation for <code>android.graphics.pdf.component.FreeTextAnnotation.setTextColor(int)</code>.</a>
